1
00:00:00,835 --> 00:00:03,465
(Amy:)riding on a train for children
around the mall.

2
00:00:05,073 --> 00:00:07,073
(Penny:)The little choo-choo
for toddlers?

3
00:00:07,075 --> 00:00:09,145
(Amy:)And now you know why
I needed the massage.

4
00:00:10,712 --> 00:00:11,912
(Howard:)Well, we're out.

5
00:00:11,913 --> 00:00:13,713
(Howard:)Bernie can't drink
'cause she's pregnant.

6
00:00:13,715 --> 00:00:15,645
(Howard:)And she's pregnant
because we had sex.

7
00:00:15,650 --> 00:00:17,080
(Howard:)And we had sex because...

8
00:00:17,085 --> 00:00:19,815
(laughs):
well, come on.

9
00:00:20,855 --> 00:00:22,885
(Bernadette:)It's okay.
You should go.

10
00:00:22,890 --> 00:00:23,860
(Howard:)You sure?

11
00:00:23,858 --> 00:00:25,058
(Bernadette:)Of course.

12
00:00:25,059 --> 00:00:28,829
(Penny:)Yeah, give her a break from,
“Well, come on.”

13
00:00:30,331 --> 00:00:32,701
(Sheldon:)Well, Bernadette, looks like
Saturday night, it's you and me.

14
00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:35,500
(Bernadette:)Me? How? Why?

15
00:00:35,503 --> 00:00:37,173
(Sheldon:)Well, it makes perfect sense.

16
00:00:37,171 --> 00:00:39,971
(Sheldon:)Because you're an expectant
mother, you can't drink alcohol.

17
00:00:39,974 --> 00:00:40,944
(Sheldon:)I don't like to.

18
00:00:40,942 --> 00:00:42,312
(Sheldon:)You can't have sushi.

19
00:00:42,310 --> 00:00:43,280
(Sheldon:)I don't like to.

20
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:44,907
(Sheldon:)You can't go in hot tubs.

21
00:00:44,912 --> 00:00:48,082
(Sheldon:)I consider them
vats of sweaty people soup.

22
00:00:49,150 --> 00:00:50,950
(Bernadette:)Gee, Sheldon, I don't know.

23
00:00:50,952 --> 00:00:52,352
(Sheldon:)Oh, come on.

24
00:00:52,353 --> 00:00:54,853
(Sheldon:)Roller coasters, caffeine,
runny eggs...

25
00:00:54,856 --> 00:00:56,686
(Sheldon:)I've been avoiding these things
all my life.

26
00:00:56,691 --> 00:00:59,961
(Sheldon:)And now, because you're
pregnant, you have to.

27
00:00:59,961 --> 00:01:02,091
(Leonard:)The difference is she's
bringing life into the world,

28
00:01:02,096 --> 00:01:04,026
(Leonard:)and you suck it out.

29
00:01:04,866 --> 00:01:06,836
(Bernadette:)I guess we could give it a try.

30
00:01:06,834 --> 00:01:09,404
(Sheldon:)Well, little lady,
you've heard of party hearty;

31
00:01:09,404 --> 00:01:12,004
(Sheldon:)get ready to party hardly.

32
00:01:13,241 --> 00:01:15,871
(Howard:)I bet you'd like
a drink right now.

33
00:01:17,578 --> 00:01:21,148
♪ Our whole universe
was in a hot, dense state ♪

